"><para.text date.updated="0">The Annual report must report on programs, policies and measures employed in that year and include the following information: GHG emissions reductions achieved, if any; applicable emissions reduction goals and status of the carbon savings account; Expert Advisory Council activity summary; Low Carbon Government Office activity summary including GHG emissions report of all applicable government entities for that year; a &ldquo;Made-in-Manitoba Climate and Green Fund&rdquo; activities report, including a list of those receiving money and projects, studies or activities supported by the fund.<footnote date.updated="0"><footnote.reference date.updated="0">25</footnote.reference><footnote.body date.updated="0"><para date.updated="0"><para.text date.updated="0"><ital>The Climate and Green Plan Act</ital>, C.C.S.M., c. C134, s. 5(1)-(6).</para.text></para></footnote.body></footnote></para.text></para><para date.updated="0"><para.text date.updated="0">The Five-year report must be completed no later than 18 months after the five-year period to which the report relates<footnote date.updated="0"><footnote.reference date.updated="0">26</footnote.reference><footnote.body date.updated="0"><para date.updated="0"><para.text date.updated="0"><ital>The Climate and Green Plan Act</ital>, C.C.S.M., c. C134, s. 6(3).</para.text></para></footnote.body></footnote><?WGXPPrightHandPageStart sp=";;51" nep=";;53" hyphenated="n" folio="8-51" backFolio="8-52" backBlank="n" releaseNumber="4" releaseDate="2022;12;30" ?> and must include the following information: total amount of GHG emissions in Manitoba in that period; total amount of GHG emissions that would have occurred in that period if no new reduction measures had been implemented in that period; total GHG emissions reductions achieved in that period due to the implementation of new reduction measures in that period; and the GHG emissions reduction goal for that period and whether it was achieved.<footnote date.updated="0"><footnote.reference date.updated="0">27</footnote.reference><footnote.body date.updated="0"><para date.updated="0"><para.text date.updated="0"><ital>The Climate and Green Plan Act</ital>, C.C.S.M., c. C134, s. 6(2).</para.text></para></footnote.body></footnote></para.text></para><para date.updated="0"><para.text date.updated="0">A copy of the Annual report or the Five-year report (as the case may be) must be tabled by the Minister &ldquo;within 15 days after it has been prepared if the Assembly is sitting or, if it is not, within 15 days after the next sitting begins&rdquo;.<footnote date.updated="0"><footnote.reference date.updated="0">28</footnote.reference><footnote.body date.updated="0"><para date.updated="0"><para.text date.updated="0"><ital>The Climate and Green Plan Act</ital>, C.C.S.M., c. C134, ss. 5(7) and s. 6(4).</para.text></para></footnote.body></footnote></para.text></para><head align="l" toc.include="y" date.updated="0"><name.block toc.include="y" date.updated="0"><name date.updated="0"><bold>Other Consequential Amendments</bold></name></name.block></head><para date.updated="0"><para.text date.updated="0"><ital>The 2018 Climate and Green Plan Act</ital> repealed <ital>The Sustainable Development Act</ital><footnote date.updated="0"><footnote.reference date.updated="0">29</footnote.reference><footnote.body date.updated="0"><para date.updated="0"><para.text date.updated="0"><ital>The Climate and Green Plan Act</ital>, C.C.S.M., c. C134, s. 13(b). See also <ital>The Sustainable Development Act</ital>, C.C.S.M., c. S270 (repealed).</para.text></para></footnote.body></footnote> and <ital>The Climate Change and Emissions Reductions Act</ital>.<footnote date.updated="0"><footnote.reference date.updated="0">30</footnote.reference><footnote.body date.updated="0"><para date.updated="0"><para.text date.updated="0"><ital>The Climate and Green Plan Act</ital>, C.C.S.M., c. C134, s. 13(a). See also <ital>The Climate Change and Emissions Reduction Act</ital>, C.C.S.M. c. C135 (repealed).</para.text></para></footnote.body></footnote></para.text></para><para date.updated="0"><para.text date.updated="0">See this chapter at <cite finder="manual" type="secondaryxref"><ref ref.id="I0bc27fd05f4d11ed98ebdf198970e0c5" secrange="y" secref="8:8 and 8:18">&dblsect;8:8 and 8:18</ref></cite> for further discussion.</para.text></para></section.body></section><